	"T3DDrawScale" "0.900000"
	"T3DMessageText" "My God.. those things are everywhere.  If any of you workers get this message, get as quick as you can to the east cargo area.  We're gonna try to hole up in there and pray to God that the ISAF arrive before we're all dead."
	"T3DMessageText2" "The bugs have damaged some of the machinery and the generator in Corridor A5 is firing loose charge all over the place.  Make sure you don't touch the electric beam when you move through."
